<title>POLAND: Animex Q1 net falls to PLN 3.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Animex Q1 net falls to PLN 3.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animex preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.77 vs	4.18</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.46 vs	4.68</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.27 vs	3.90</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Animex SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				127.48 vs    108.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 112.98 vs     95.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.63 vs	4.69</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    11.76 vs     28.88</p>
<p>    financial costs			  9.92 vs     28.38</p>
<p>    investment				 5.06 vs	4.25</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
